1
00:00:00,177 --> 00:00:01,847
- What's up?
- What's up?

2
00:00:03,472 --> 00:00:05,102
(Leonard:)You ever make it to the dentist?

3
00:00:05,265 --> 00:00:10,185
Not necessary. I found a service that'll send
a van to your house for a teeth cleaning.

4
00:00:10,354 --> 00:00:12,354
(Sheldon:)Mostly they cater to dogs...

5
00:00:14,650 --> 00:00:17,820
(Sheldon:)...but the fellow on the phone
seemed to have an open mind.

6
00:00:18,070 --> 00:00:22,120
(Leonard:)All right, Sheldon, if you need me
to take you to the dentist, I will take you.

7
00:00:22,282 --> 00:00:24,912
(Sheldon:)Are you suggesting
that you've come to your senses...

8
00:00:25,077 --> 00:00:29,787
...and wish to reestablish the benefits
that stem from the Roommate Agreement?

9
00:00:29,957 --> 00:00:34,507
Absolutely. If you admit you're a 30-year-old
man incapable of functioning on his own.

10
00:00:35,129 --> 00:00:37,879
(Raj:)Ooh. Sock Mouth's got him on the ropes.

11
00:00:39,591 --> 00:00:42,721
(Sheldon:)I will admit nothing of the sort.
And now, if you'll excuse me...

12
00:00:42,886 --> 00:00:58,026
(Sheldon:)...I have to call my dentist and see if I can
get my hair shampooed and nails clipped.

